WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
PawCare connects neighbors who spot an animal in need with people able to help.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The assistance map shows verified rescue cases, with the most urgent requests highlighted.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Browse animals listed for adoption by shelters.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A demo reporter tracks a submitted rescue report while it waits for review.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
An administrator verifies the report so it can enter the volunteer queue.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A volunteer reviews the priority queue and accepts the verified rescue.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The assigned case moves into In Progress as the volunteer coordinates help.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.040
The volunteer marks the case Resolved. Contact details shown are synthetic demo data.
